v 3
d svyslim: Reduce complex survey data to a subpopulation while preserving
d          design-based inference (svy, subpop() on the reduced file
d          reproduces the full-data result). Includes a one-line prefix
d          form, totals and impute() options, and verification do-files.
d
d Requires: Stata version 14.0 or newer, and data declared with svyset.
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260722
d
d Author:  David Aduragbemi Okunlola
d          Department of Sociology, Florida State University
d Support: email okunloladavid4@gmail.com
d
f svyslim.ado
f svyslim.sthlp
f svyslim_verify.do
f svyslim_models_test.do
f svyslim_dhs_test.do
f svyslim_oneline_test.do
